# Release sidecar written next to the repo root by RELEASING.md step 5
# (`rexenv_<X.Y.Z>_universal.dmg.sha256`). The published asset and the cask are the
# authoritative copies — a tracked one would be a fourth place for the hash to drift.
/rexenv_*_universal.dmg.sha256
